---
// OurTechFeatures.astro - 7 alternating editorial workflow & integration sections
---

<section class="tech-features" id="tech-workflows" aria-label="Technology workflow capabilities">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- 1. A better way to work -->
    <div class="tech-split">
      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal>
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">A better way to work</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Creative workflows are broken. <span class="title-highlight">We fixed the process, not just the tool.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          We designed a workflow that works on the tools you already trust, configured precisely for how creative work actually gets done.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          The result is a creative operation that feels like an extension of your team.
        </p>
        <div class="tech-split__cta">
          <a href="#book-a-call" class="adaptif-btn" data-open-book-call>
            <span>Book a Call</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M4.16666 10H15.8333M15.8333 10L10 4.16666M15.8333 10L10 15.8333"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__media glass-panel" data-tech-reveal="scale" style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/conductor.jpg"
          alt="Creative conductor orchestrating workflows"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Your creative process, supercharged -->
    <div class="tech-split tech-split--reverse">
      <div class="tech-split__media glass-panel" data-tech-reveal="scale">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/stack-setup.jpg"
          alt="Adaptif workspace configured inside your existing stack"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">Your creative process, supercharged</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Your stack, <span class="title-highlight">our setup</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          When you onboard with Adaptif, we configure your workspace inside ClickUp, Asana, or whatever tool your team already runs on.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          Briefs, timelines, feedback, approvals, and file delivery all happen inside a workflow we’ve spent years refining — built on software you already know how to use. No steep learning curve. No parallel systems. Just your tools, working harder than they ever have.
        </p>
        <div class="tech-split__cta">
          <a href="#book-a-call" class="adaptif-btn" data-open-book-call>
            <span>Book a Call</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M4.16666 10H15.8333M15.8333 10L10 4.16666M15.8333 10L10 15.8333"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Teamwork without friction -->
    <div class="tech-split">
      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal>
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">Teamwork without friction</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Feedback that actually <span class="title-highlight">reaches the right person.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          Every comment, revision request, and approval happens inside your project management tool — not lost in an email chain or a Slack thread no one can find.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          Your team and ours always know where things stand, what’s waiting on them, and what’s already done.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__ui" data-tech-reveal="scale" style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/feedback-ui.jpg"
          alt="Contextual feedback and approvals inside your project board"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. AI briefing -->
    <div class="tech-split tech-split--reverse">
      <div class="tech-split__ui" data-tech-reveal="scale">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/briefing-ui.jpg"
          alt="Structured AI-assisted creative brief templates"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">AI briefing</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Briefs that get <span class="title-highlight">read</span> — and acted on.
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          A vague brief is the number one reason creative work misses the mark on the first round.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          We solve it with structured brief templates built into your workflow, with AI assistance to help you add the detail that matters. Your creative team gets everything they need to start strong — and you spend less time in revision.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. Full visibility -->
    <div class="tech-split">
      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal>
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">Full visibility</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Your subscription capacity, <span class="title-highlight">always visible.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          Track costs and manage resources.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          See exactly how your tickets are going across all your brands and projects — updated in real time. No end of month surprises, no need to ask for a status update. You always know what’s in flight, what’s delivered, and how much capacity you have left.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__ui" data-tech-reveal="scale" style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/visibility-ui.jpg"
          alt="Real-time team capacity and ticket visibility"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Everything in one place -->
    <div class="tech-split tech-split--reverse">
      <div class="tech-split__ui" data-tech-reveal="scale">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/assets-ui.jpg"
          alt="Delivered creative assets organized directly in your ticket"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">Everything in one place</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          Every <span class="title-highlight">delivered file</span>, right where the task lives
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          No more “Where’s that file?!” moments. We’ve got you covered.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          Finished assets are linked directly to their ticket — no separate platform, no file request email. Everything lands in your Google Drive, Dropbox, or shared folder of choice, organized by project and ready to use the moment it’s approved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 7. Integrations -->
    <div class="tech-split">
      <div class="tech-split__body" data-tech-reveal>
        <p class="adaptif-eyebrow">Integrations</p>
        <h2 class="tech-split__title">
          <span class="title-highlight">We come to you.</span> Not the other way around
        </h2>
        <p class="tech-split__lead">
          Most creative partners ask you to learn their tools. We work inside yours.
        </p>
        <p class="tech-split__desc">
          Whether your team runs on ClickUp, Asana, Trello, Notion, or something else entirely — we set up and manage your creative workflow right there, so switching to Adaptif feels like turning on a new channel, not changing the whole TV.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-split__media glass-panel" data-tech-reveal="scale" style="--tech-delay: 100ms">
        <img
          src="/images/our-technology/integrations-hub.jpg"
          alt="Adaptif integrated with ClickUp, Asana, Jira, Slack, Trello, and Wrike"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tech-features {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px) 0 clamp(48px, 7vw, 84px);
    background-color: var(--color-void);
  }

  .tech-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 76px);
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .tech-split__title {
    margin: 14px 0 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .tech-split__lead {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .tech-split__desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .tech-split__cta {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .tech-split__media {
    border-radius: 22px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tech-split__media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .tech-split__ui {
    position: relative;
  }

  .tech-split__ui img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    mix-blend-mode: lighten;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .tech-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .tech-split--reverse .tech-split__media,
    .tech-split--reverse .tech-split__ui {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
